<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-export SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/evernote-export4.dtd">
<en-export export-date="20261017T030000Z" application="Evernote" version="10.0">
  <note>
    <title>欢迎使用 GreenNotes</title>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">
<en-note><div>这是一篇示例笔记，可以直接改成你自己的内容。</div><div><br/></div><div><b>三个栏位，各管一件事：</b></div><ul><li>左边：笔记本（可新建、双击改名、右键菜单）</li><li>中间：笔记列表（按更新时间倒序）</li><li>右边：编辑器，改完点「保存」或按 ⌘S</li></ul><div>顶部搜索框是全文搜索，标题和正文一起搜，中文两字也能命中。</div></en-note>]]>
    </content>
    <created>20261017T020000Z</created>
    <updated>20261017T020000Z</updated>
    <tag>入门</tag>
    <note-attributes>
      <author>GreenNotes</author>
      <source>desktop.mac</source>
    </note-attributes>
  </note>
  <note>
    <title>富文本与图片示例</title>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">
<en-note><div>编辑器支持这些常用格式：</div><div><br/></div><div><b>加粗</b>、<i>斜体</i>、<u>下划线</u>、<span style="font-family:Courier">等宽字体</span></div><ul><li>无序列表</li><li>有序列表</li></ul><div>正文里可以插入图片：</div><div><en-media hash="8f9dff3de3be3e0bdbc975fbeeb7c52f" type="image/png"/></div><div><br/></div><div>图片会随笔记一起存进本地 assets 目录，导出 ENEX 时也会一并带上。</div></en-note>]]>
    </content>
    <created>20261017T021000Z</created>
    <updated>20261017T021000Z</updated>
    <tag>示例</tag>
    <tag>富文本</tag>
    <note-attributes>
      <author>GreenNotes</author>
      <source>desktop.mac</source>
    </note-attributes>
    <resource>
      <data encoding="base64" hash="8f9dff3de3be3e0bdbc975fbeeb7c52f"></data>
      <mime>image/png</mime>
      <width>640</width>
      <height>220</height>
      <resource-attributes><file-name>greennote-banner.png</file-name></resource-attributes>
    </resource>
  </note>
  <note>
    <title>从别的笔记软件搬过来</title>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">
<en-note><div>点右上角「导入」，支持这些格式：</div><ul><li>Evernote 导出文件 <b>.enex</b>（含附件）</li><li>印象笔记 / 有道云笔记导出的 HTML、Markdown、纯文本</li><li>Obsidian 笔记库、Sublime 的 .sublime-project 关联文件</li><li>普通文件夹批量导入（递归）</li></ul><div>导入的笔记会归到一个新建的笔记本里，原始内容不做改写。</div></en-note>]]>
    </content>
    <created>20261017T022000Z</created>
    <updated>20261017T022000Z</updated>
    <tag>导入</tag>
    <note-attributes>
      <author>GreenNotes</author>
      <source>desktop.mac</source>
    </note-attributes>
  </note>
</en-export>
